# CONTROL: default.grammar with ONE corrupted row (key 1 behind its own lock). Must fail W2.
# nexus, stronghold, boss, exit; cycles A and B (2 independent cycles); grown to 24-40 rooms.
# Rows run in order; see src/mission.cpp for the row forms. Skeleton first, then the leaves.
add  E  entrance
add  N0 nexus
link E  N0
add  H0 room
link N0 H0
add  J0 room
cycle H0 J0 A 2 1
add  L1 lock:1
link J0 L1
add  H1 haven
link L1 H1
add  J1 room
cycle H1 J1 B 1 2
add  L2 lock:2
link J1 L2
add  F2 stronghold
link L2 F2
add  R2 room
link F2 R2
add  L3 lock:3
link R2 L3
add  B  boss
link L3 B
add  X  exit
link B  X
# leaves: each key in the region before its lock
hang K1 key:1 H1 Ba1    # CORRUPTED (control): key 1 hung behind lock 1
hang K2 key:2 Ba1 Bb1 Bb2
hang K3 key:3 F2 R2
hang T0 treasure H0 J0 Aa1 Ab1
hang T1 treasure F2 R2
hang S0 secret H0 Aa2 Ab1
hang S1 secret J1 Bb1
grow 24 40
